cff-version: 1.2.0
title: local-engineer
message: >-
  If you use this software or its methodology in academic work, please cite it
  using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ali
    alias: akynte
repository-code: https://github.com/akynte/local-engineer
abstract: >-
  A supervised local coding engineer: a deterministic harness around a local
  language model, with per-project isolation enforced at the storage layer, a
  typed code-relationship graph with evidence categories, an intent-first
  execution journal with crash recovery, and layered unprivileged sandboxing.
keywords:
  - code-generation
  - local-inference
  - software-engineering-agents
  - program-analysis
  - sandboxing
license: Apache-2.0
